==Battleground==
*10 [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawn after 3 seconds<sup>90f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Sardine (Enemy)|Sardines]] spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Young Man Mola (Enemy)|Young Man Molas]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squid (Enemy)|Squid]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sardine (Enemy)|Sardines]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Young Man Mola (Enemy)|Young Man Molas]] spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**5 [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crabs]] spawn, delay 53.33~66.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Mola King (Enemy)|Mola King]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Young Man Mola (Enemy)|Young Man Molas]] spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**2 [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crabs]] spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

